under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\"],\"scope_text\":\"For baggage transported or offered for transport by a passenger in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under 49 CFR 1562.23.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1376,\"summary\":\"A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under 49 CFR 1562.23 any loaded firearm(s).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
