      "rkaf:appliesInJurisdiction": [],
      "rkaf:applicabilityCondition": "For baggage transported or offered for transport by a passenger in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under 49 CFR 1562.23, unless: (i) the passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded; (ii) the firearm is unloaded; (iii) the firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and (iv) the container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination."
    },
