        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(d) Ammunition. This section does not prohibit the carriage of ammunition in checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm. Title 49 CFR part 175 provides additional requirements governing carriage of ammunition on aircraft."
